<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="{{ csp }}"><title>{{ model.title }}</title><style>{{ stylesheet }}</style></head><body class="{{ theme }}"><main><header><div class="eyebrow">Strategy Reporting · 正式运行</div><h1>{{ view.strategy_id }} · 正式运行报告</h1><div class="muted">NautilusTrader {{ model.engine.engine_version }} · formal {{ view.formal_id }}</div></header>
<section><h2>本次运行</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="muted">运行状态</div><div class="value">{{ view.outcome }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">拓扑</div><div class="value">{{ model.subject.topology }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">运行 ID</div><div class="value compact">{{ view.run_id }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">Attempt ID</div><div class="value compact">{{ view.attempt_id }}</div></div></div><div class="notice">这是该冻结快照的单次正式运行结果；研究层面的复现结论请以关联 Research Study 报告为准。</div></section>
<section><h2>账户与原生指标</h2><div class="grid">{% for item in view.account %}<div class="card"><div class="muted">{{ item.label }}</div><div class="value">{{ item.value }}</div></div>{% endfor %}{% for item in view.native_metrics %}<div class="card"><div class="muted">{{ item.group }} · {{ item.label }}</div><div class="value">{{ item.value }}</div></div>{% endfor %}</div><p class="notice">净值与回撤图由同一 publication 的原生 Nautilus tearsheet 提供；在 Portal 中可打开 <a href="nautilus-tearsheet.html">净值／回撤图</a>。</p>{% if not model.performance.portfolio_returns %}<div class="notice">收益序列为空；原生 tearsheet 会显示合法空态。</div>{% endif %}</section>
<section><h2>数据身份</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="muted">标的</div><div class="value">{{ view.market.instruments }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">请求区间</div><div class="value">{{ view.market.start }} 至 {{ view.market.end }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">频率／复权</div><div class="value">{{ view.market.frequency }} / {{ view.market.adjustment }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">冻结快照</div><div class="value compact">{{ view.market.snapshot_id }}</div></div></div><p class="muted">数据版本：{{ view.market.dataset_version }}；coverage identity：{{ view.market.coverage_hash }}</p></section>
<section><h2>交易与成本</h2><div class="grid">{% for item in view.execution_counts %}<div class="card"><div class="muted">{{ item.label }}</div><div class="value">{{ item.value }}</div></div>{% endfor %}</div>{% for item in view.cost %}<p class="muted">{{ item.label }}：{{ item.value }}</p>{% endfor %}</section>
{% for name, label, preview in execution_sections %}<section><h2>{{ label }}</h2><div class="muted">共 {{ preview.total_rows }} 行，展示 {{ preview.rows|length }} 行，省略 {{ preview.omitted_count }} 行。</div>{% if preview.rows %}<table><thead><tr>{% for key in preview.rows[0].keys() %}<th>{{ key }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in preview.rows %}<tr>{% for value in row.values() %}<td>{{ value }}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>{% else %}<div class="notice">没有已发布记录。</div>{% endif %}</section>{% endfor %}
<footer>本报告只展示 Workspace 中已验证的已发布事实，不重新计算 Nautilus 指标。</footer></main></body></html>
